{"product_id":"star-style-8-my-sister-the-vampire","title":"Star Style (8) (My Sister the Vampire)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn their eighth adventure, Olivia and Jessica find themselves competing for a role in a vamp romanceIt's the premiere of The Groves, the Hollywood film Olivia had a small part in as a goth. Jackson, her Hollywood heartthrob boyfriend, wanted to walk down the red carpet with her, but a fashion disaster makes that out of the question. And then a top Hollywood producer mistakes Ivy, in her goth gear, for Olivia. Meanwhile, the twins' biological dad seems to be hanging around the film's second director an awful lot.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Sienna Mercer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405257008\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45788201123993,"sku":"16RD-19781405257008","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ecd2a5def07_Star_Style__8___My_Sister_the_Vampire__Sienna_Mercer.jpg?v=1760372346","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/star-style-8-my-sister-the-vampire","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}